---
import { ASSESSMENT_HREF, WHATSAPP_HREF } from '../../lib/home';
---

<section class="section-container not-prose" id="start">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-md bg-slate-50 px-6 py-12 text-center dark:bg-slate-900 md:px-12 md:py-16">
    <h2 class="font-heading mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
      Not sure what your next step should be?
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mb-2 max-w-2xl text-xl font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">That's okay.</p>
    <p class="mx-auto mb-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
      You don't need to have everything figured out before you contact us.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl text-base text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
      Tell us what you're planning, where you're hoping to go, or what you're trying to build. We'll help you
      understand your options and the steps involved.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
      <a href={ASSESSMENT_HREF} class="btn-primary">Start My Assessment</a>
      <a href={WHATSAPP_HREF} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-whatsapp">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
      No pressure. No false promises. Just a clear conversation about your options.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
